  "goodToKnow": "Die Buchhaltung is bookkeeping and the accounts department: in der Buchhaltung arbeiten, Rechnungen an die Buchhaltung schicken. Der Buchhalter (die Buchhalterin) is a bookkeeper, and calling someone a Buchhalter can mean pedantic. German businesses must keep records for up to ten years, and many use a Steuerberater (tax adviser). Die doppelte Buchführung is double-entry bookkeeping. Plural: die Buchhaltungen."
